# Arth — Cursor rules

Governed by THE ARTH BRAND SYSTEM v2.9 in `docs/brand/The_Arth_Brand_System_v2.9.md`.

## Product

Enquiry accountability for automobile dealer groups. Not a CRM.

## Binding

- Part 3 Identity, Part 5 Interface, Part 6 Tenancy, Part 9 tokens
- Part 4 for all UI copy. Controlled vocabulary is binding.
- Tokens in `src/styles/arth-tokens.css` are the only colour source. Never map Brass to a generic accent.
- Shells: A queue, B record, C The Exception Cockpit. No fourth shell.
- The Exception Cockpit is never called a dashboard.
- No amber. No gradients. No Inter/Poppins/Montserrat/Roboto. No AI on the homepage.
- Indian grouping for rupees. Enquiry not lead. Branch not rooftop.
